{"ticker":"ECL","updated":"2026-10-30T22:46:03Z","profile":{"longName":"Ecolab Inc.","shortName":"Ecolab Inc.","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Specialty Chemicals","country":"United States","website":"https://www.ecolab.com","fullTimeEmployees":48000,"marketCap":84933967872,"trailingPE":41.22177,"forwardPE":32.19999,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.8890457,"pegRatio":2.38,"targetMeanPrice":330.57144,"targetHighPrice":360.0,"targetLowPrice":300.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":21,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.127,"earningsGrowth":-0.049,"grossMargins":0.44043,"operatingMargins":0.1903,"profitMargins":0.119890004,"totalRevenue":17372299264,"beta":0.879,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":309.27,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":243.15,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.97},"summary":"Ecolab Inc. provides water, hygiene, and infection prevention solutions and services in the United States and internationally. The company operates through four segments: Global Water, Global Institutional & Specialty, Global Pest Elimination, and Global Life Sciences. The Global Water segment offers water treatment and process applications, and cleaning and sanitizing solutions to manufacturing, food and beverage processing, transportation, chemical, primary metals and mining, power generation, global refining, petrochemical, pulp and paper industries. The Global Institutional & Specialty segment provides cleaning and sanitizing products to the foodservice, healthcare, hospitality, lodging, government, education and retail industries. The Global Pest Elimination segment provides pest elimination services to detect, prevent, and eliminate pests comprising rodents and insects in full-service and quick-service restaurants, food and beverage processors, hotels, grocery operations, and other commercial segments, including education, life sciences, and healthcare. The Global Life Sciences segment provides cleaning and contamination control solutions to pharmaceutical and personal care manufacturers. It offers its products under the Ecolab, Kay, Purolite, and Bioquell brand names. The company sells its products through field sales and corporate account personnel, distributors, and de","summary_zh":"Ecolab Inc. 在美國和國際上提供水、衛生和感染預防解決方案和服務。該公司透過四個部門運營：全球水務部門、全球機構與專業部門、全球害蟲消除部門和全球生命科學部門。全球水務部門為製造、食品和飲料加工、運輸、化學、初級金屬和採礦、發電、全球煉油、石化、紙漿和造紙行業提供水處理和工藝應用以及清潔和消毒解決方案。全球機構和專業部門為餐飲服務、醫療保健、飯店、住宿、政府、教育和零售業提供清潔和消毒產品。全球害蟲消除部門提供害蟲消除服務，以檢測、預防和消除全方位服務和快餐餐廳、食品和飲料加工商、酒店、雜貨店以及其他商業領域（包括教育、生命科學和醫療保健）中的囓齒動物和昆蟲等害蟲。全球生命科學部門為製藥和個人護理製造商提供清潔和污染控制解決方案。該公司以 Ecolab、Kay、Purolite 和 Bioquell 品牌提供產品。該公司透過現場銷售和公司客戶人員、分銷商和經銷商銷售其產品。","sector_zh":"基礎材料","industry_zh":"特種化學品","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":275.26,"h":276.66,"l":274.28,"c":274.79,"v":988800},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":274.38,"h":275.56,"l":271.81,"c":273.23,"v":1428900},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":273.97,"h":275.35,"l":272.87,"c":274.94,"v":1526600},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":276.35,"h":277.5,"l":272.96,"c":273.56,"v":1244000},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":273.28,"h":275.62,"l":271.39,"c":275.35,"v":1595600},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":273.82,"h":274.54,"l":270.38,"c":270.66,"v":1367400},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":269.92,"h":271.62,"l":268.08,"c":269.09,"v":1373000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":269.22,"h":275.39,"l":268.72,"c":274.88,"v":930500},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":272.81,"h":275.17,"l":272.45,"c":272.62,"v":1127100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":272.6,"h":273.73,"l":270.6,"c":270.61,"v":1119100},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":269.44,"h":270.55,"l":263.77,"c":264.06,"v":1254900},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":265.0,"h":268.0,"l":264.29,"c":265.36,"v":1338900},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":264.68,"h":266.8,"l":264.24,"c":264.83,"v":2375900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":265.08,"h":266.42,"l":263.89,"c":265.48,"v":2441200},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":264.98,"h":267.84,"l":263.49,"c":267.09,"v":1468100},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":266.36,"h":268.0,"l":265.24,"c":265.81,"v":1254700},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":265.63,"h":267.62,"l":265.15,"c":267.0,"v":1778700},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":267.17,"h":269.15,"l":266